 女宝宝，穿着浅绿色恐龙元素套装（上衣带恐龙背刺，裤子带恐龙脚印印花），影棚内浅粉色背景搭配彩色气球串（含恐龙形状气球），宝宝站在中间，双手环抱大号恐龙玩偶，身边两侧各放 1 个中号恐龙模型，双脚分开站立微笑看向镜头，画面对称温馨。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "系列提示词案例", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [578.6143188476562, 496.6655578613281], "pos": [-2254.000244140625, 3181.548583984375], "id": 249, "properties": {}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [348], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [374.050537109375, 122.8463363647461], "pos": [-932.6800537109375, 4123.8271484375], "widgets_values": ["qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors", "qwen_image", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "CLIP名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "类型"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "设备"}], "flags": {}, "id": 214, "type": "CLIPLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "links": [344, 349], "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "size": [375.0415344238281, 83.76486206054688], "pos": [-945.8828125, 4302.1015625], "widgets_values": ["qwen_image_vae.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "name": "vae_name", "label": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "vae名称"}], "flags": {}, "id": 215, "type": "VAELoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAELoader"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [506.83880615234375, 651.5186767578125], "pos": [337.4371337890625, 3722.97509765625], "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 347, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "